<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80361" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείρινς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ινθος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wicker basket</i> tied upon the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμαξα</span>, <i>body of the cart</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείρινθα δὲ δῆσαι ἐπ᾽ αὐτῆς [ἀμάξης]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.190
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				267
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μὲν ἐς πείρινθα τίθει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.131
				</span></i>
			.—<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only uses the acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείρινθα</span>; gen. , <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.873
			</span></i> : <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείρινθος</span></b>  cited
			as nom. by <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
					<u>EM</u>668.21</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείρινθα</span></b> ,
			ibid.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
